      "design": "r0C",
      "good": "All six months are visible within the viewport, and the month columns have a consistent rhythm.",
      "problems": "Region names, two headers, and many sales figures split across lines, including within numbers. The unusually tall rows and fragmented values make both across-row and down-column comparison difficult.",
      "cause": "The 65px region column leaves only 44px for text, less than the longest individual word. Each 49px month column leaves 28px, less than the 38px needed for the widest figures and some headers."
